- Set performance budgets
- Ensure idempotency for writes

### Observability & Security

- Use structured logging with trace IDs
- No sensitive data in logs
- Metrics and alerts in place
- Dependency audits in CI
- System health page: Most, if not all features requiring external systems (including infrastructure systems such as DBMS) should be part of the system health page

### Database Migrations

- Consistent DBMS: MySQL 8.4.x
- Reversible, small migrations
- Document schema guidelines
- Seeders and factories available

### Documentation

